

>> usedMemory1 := 0.
>> usedMemory2 := 0.
>> usedMemory3 := 0.
>> usedMemory4 := 0.

>> x := 100.

ፕሮግራም የትውስታ-አስተዳደር: 0.

{
>> txt := ['hello '] + ['world'].
txt := txt + [' - can we use strings.. '].
txt := txt + ['without leaking '] + x + ['s of bytes ?'].
txt መጨረሻ-ላይ-ጨምር: ['!!'].
ውጤት ፃፍ: txt.
} ጀምር.

ፕሮግራም አጽዳ.

usedMemory1 := (ፕሮግራም ማህደረ-ትውስታ ? 0).


{
>> txt := ['hello '] + ['world'].
txt := txt + [' - can we use strings.. '].
txt := txt + ['without leaking '] + x + ['s of bytes ?'].
txt መጨረሻ-ላይ-ጨምር: ['!!'].
ውጤት ፃፍ: txt.
} ጀምር.

ፕሮግራም አጽዳ.
usedMemory2 := (ፕሮግራም ማህደረ-ትውስታ ? 0).


{
>> txt := ['hello '] + ['world'].
txt := txt + [' - can we use strings.. '].
txt := txt + ['without leaking '] + x + ['s of bytes ?'].
txt መጨረሻ-ላይ-ጨምር: ['!!'].
ውጤት ፃፍ: txt.
} ጀምር.

ፕሮግራም አጽዳ.
usedMemory3 := (ፕሮግራም ማህደረ-ትውስታ ? 0).



( usedMemory1 = usedMemory2 እና: usedMemory1 = usedMemory3, እና: usedMemory2 = usedMemory3 ) እውነት-ከሆነ: {
	ውጤት ፃፍ: ['No memory leaks here'].
}, ሐሰት-ከሆነ: {
	ውጤት ፃፍ: ['Leaking memory...'].
}.
